### Create a new event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Torneo Apertura 2026",
  "description": "Torneo oficial de apertura de la temporada",
  "startDate": "2026-03-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-15"
}

### Create another event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Copa Verano 2026",
  "description": "Torneo amistoso de verano",
  "startDate": "2026-01-15",
  "endDate": "2026-02-28"
}

### Get all events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### Get event by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID

### Register a club to an event (replace with actual IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clubId": 2
}

### Get all registrations for an event (replace with actual event ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID/registrations
